  "Dating apps algorithmically reward consistency between your photo tags, prompt answers, and actual visual evidence. When your photos confirm your written bio, trust levels surge.": "Les applications valorisent la cohérence entre vos tags photo, vos réponses aux prompts et les preuves visuelles. Quand les photos confirment votre bio, la confiance augmente.",
